This tutorial is the multi-scale simulation on SNW based on tutorial 14. We have modified some code and they are explained below:
(1) 'environment_variables' file is modified to find the correct executable path.
(2) 'NanoTCAD_ViDES.py' is modified to construct cylindrical region.
(3) 'run_QE' file is modified to construct the supercell of silicon and compute the correct band structure.
(4) 'run_Wannier' file is modified to transform the Bloch electron wavefunction into a TB Wannier function.
(5) 'Wannier2ViDES' file is changed to reserve all the interactions between adjacent supercells and abandon all the others. Thus the cutoff parameter in this code is useless and should be set to a large number such as 200nm.
(6) 'IdVg_Vd=0.1.py' is the file constructing the MOSFET structures and run within the NanoTCAD package.
（7）‘wannier_center.xyz’ and 'Wannier2ViDES.H' files contained the orbital coordinates and Hamiltonian got from the Quantum Espresso and Wannier90.